{"name": "Seaward", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2728 Quick Feature Overview:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Exploration<br/>\ud83d\udee5\ufe0f Ship Customization<br/>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Decorating<br/>\ud83d\udcf8 Taking Photos<br/>\ud83c\udf31 Gardening<br/>\ud83c\udfa3 Fishing<br/>\ud83d\udcac Dialogues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"94\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/2c129fb27d76f980165aa1a9cb46dde8.avif?t=1785150950\" width=\"780\"/></span>In this flooded world you <strong>become a courier</strong>, connecting people with your ship. Scattered across islands you'll find resources to <strong>improve your ship</strong> and <strong>make it your home</strong>. Help out cute characters and build a community. And don't forget to take photos along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/77795b0f428e5e69a460509b551f5787.poster.avif?t=1785150950\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/77795b0f428e5e69a460509b551f5787.webm?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/77795b0f428e5e69a460509b551f5787.mp4?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"94\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/3cc8fefd3af48cd25a8abc40df23aac5.avif?t=1785150950\" width=\"780\"/></span>In a grid-like view, you can build new things onto your ship. Or change the ship's hull entirely, which will determine the shape and size of the building space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/48b44bb5680758771309f9c5098c368a.poster.avif?t=1785150950\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/48b44bb5680758771309f9c5098c368a.webm?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/48b44bb5680758771309f9c5098c368a.mp4?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"94\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/6478d0f0514dcc8048dfaa8945affb39.avif?t=1785150950\" width=\"780\"/></span>This world inhibits several unique characters. Get to know them and help each other out! Share your skills and you might get something in return. Together you can build a wholesome community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8f9df8091210b22e6bd0cb21b7d4df68.poster.avif?t=1785150950\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8f9df8091210b22e6bd0cb21b7d4df68.webm?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8f9df8091210b22e6bd0cb21b7d4df68.mp4?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"94\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/6fecc0caf591a7f1e74ac23f6af020af.avif?t=1785150950\" width=\"780\"/></span>Equipped with a photo camera, you can make travel memories. Catalogue birds, plants, characters or just take some snapshots of pretty vistas. They all get saved into your personal journal. In the end, it\u2019s your very own journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/3bcf2536b6d6d8a2414bfacfbc626c31.poster.avif?t=1785150950\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/3bcf2536b6d6d8a2414bfacfbc626c31.webm?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/3bcf2536b6d6d8a2414bfacfbc626c31.mp4?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Seaward is a cozy exploration game where you build a ship to discover a flooded world. Find resources and power your ship with renewable energies. Meet unique characters and help them out to build a wholesome community. Make the journey your own by taking photos and filling up your journal.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/d3a79102f7cc657fd5154c8e495fa18a0f5a7fe5/header.jpg?t=1785150950", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Cozy", "Exploration", "Open World", "Nature", "Wholesome", "Adventure"], "developers": "THE ROOF Interactive", "publishers": "THE ROOF Interactive", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3430280", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "18 April 2026 - Request Access\n\n20 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ERa1ra9dZXw", "first_seen": 1776463200.0, "review_rank": 831}